# RE = Read Email (post-login --once + Anwenden arm)

**Chat scope:** Email processing chat only (`EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`).

**Always stick to the processing form:** Full 7-step output from **sprinklr-read-answer-email** SKILL.md.

**AI model (ABSOLUTE):** Model picker stays **Auto**. **Grok is banned.**

## Detached arm (mandatory — why watches used to “die”)

Cursor **aborts** long-running agent shells (~20s) when a turn ends. That used to kill the in-shell Anwenden/Weiter/Extern watch → `ERROR: ANWENDEN WATCH DIED BEFORE EXTRACT` → `--once` recovery.

**Fix:** `--arm` / `--arm-weiter` / `--arm-extern` spawn a **detached** Windows process by default (`ARM_WATCH_DETACHED`). Cursor aborting the shell does **not** kill the listener. Log: `.cursor/state/arm_watch.log`.

| Step | Command | Expect |
|------|---------|--------|
| 1 | `run.py --arm` (or `--arm-weiter` / `--arm-extern`) | `ARM_WATCH_DETACHED` + `READY_FOR_YOUR_CLICK` + Dexter; parent exits; **no console window** |
| 2 | Chat + finishing quote | `Armed — click … now.` + `PR done` / `LF done` / `LF TR done` |
| 3 | `run.py --await-arm` | Poll until extract **or** fail-fast on `ERROR: NEXT CASE NOT OPEN` |
| 4 | Full **7-step RE** + `--play-ready` + **Auto-LF** | Book cue after section 7; then fill Case Tracker (see `lf-log-form.mdc`) |

- **Click-ready = Dexter + READY_FOR_YOUR_CLICK** — do not wait for await to finish before clicking.
- If **`--await-arm`** is aborted by Cursor → **re-run `--await-arm`** (detached watch still running).
- If log shows **`ERROR: NEXT CASE NOT OPEN`** → **`run.py --once`** on the visible case (arm already stopped).
- Use **`--once`** also if `ARM_WATCH_LOG` has **no** CUSTOMER EMAIL after timeout.
- **Never** start a second `--arm*` while a detached watch is still waiting.
- **`--foreground`** = legacy blocking watch (debug only).

### Next-case click (after Anwenden / Weiter / Weiterleiten)

Script remembers **closed Fall #**, skips that sidebar item, polls ~25s for a different case, retries if still console/same Fall. Hard fail → stop arm + `--once` tip (no second Weiterleiten wait).

## When user sends **RE** / **re**

**Hard rule:** Typed **RE** always means **extract the currently open case now** (`--once`). It must **never** arm Anwenden / wait for an Anwenden click.

Typical workday start:
1. **login** (once)
2. Open / have first case visible in Sprinklr
3. Type **RE** → push-start: extract + full 7-step RE + **Auto-LF**
4. Non-transfer → user **PR** → agent arms Anwenden; Transfer → agent already armed Weiter/Extern after Auto-LF
5. You click Anwenden / Weiter / Weiterleiten / Next → next extract → agent continues (7-step + Auto-LF again)

1. Run default RE entrypoint:
   ```powershell
   Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py
   ```
   Expect **`MODE: --once`** and either `FIRST_RE_ONCE_CONSUMED` (after login) or `RE_ONCE_DEFAULT`. Then classify **`CHANNEL: CALL|EMAIL`** (see `sprinklr-call-vs-email.mdc`). **EMAIL** → **CUSTOMER EMAIL** + full **7-step RE** + **Auto-LF**. **CALL** → wait for user voice brief (no email RE/PR); Auto-LF after BRIEF pack.
2. **Do not** run `--arm` / `--await-arm` on typed RE. Arms run after Auto-LF / PR close-out (below).
3. **Audio:**
   - **Armed auto-RE start:** After Anwenden / Weiter / Extern / Next → 4s wait → case open → extract begins → Prowler (`ARMED_RE_START_SOUND`).
   - **RE ready (after section 7):** Hook plays book-opening cue (`RE_READY_SOUND`) when `RE_PENDING_SOUND` was set — case is ready to read.
   - **PR done / LF TR done:** Finishing quotes → Dexter (`PR_LF_DONE_SOUND`).
   - Manual: **`sound`** → `--play-ready`.
4. After 7-step + `--play-ready`: **Auto-LF** (do not wait for typed `LF`). See `.cursor/rules/lf-log-form.mdc`.
5. **EMAIL non-transfer:** wait for user **PR** → after paste succeeds → **`--arm`** + **`--await-arm`**. Finishing quote `PR done for #FALL_ID`.
6. **EMAIL / CALL transfer:** after Auto-LF Transfer Ja → **`--arm-weiter`** or **`--arm-extern`** + await. Quote `LF TR done for #FALL_ID`.
7. **CALL non-transfer:** after BRIEF pack + Auto-LF voice → **`--arm-next`** + await. Quote `LF done for #FALL_ID`.

### Explicit modes

| Command | Behavior |
|---------|----------|
| `run.py` / typed **RE** | **Always `--once`** — extract open case now (first case of day, fresh agent, or re-read) |
| `run.py --once` | Same as above (explicit) |
| `run.py --arm` | Arm Anwenden (**detached**; after **PR** on EMAIL non-transfer) |
| `run.py --arm-weiter` | Arm Weiter (**detached**; after transfer Auto-LF / LF TR **queue**) |
| `run.py --arm-extern` | Arm Extern (**detached**; after transfer Auto-LF / LF TR **email**) |
| `run.py --arm-next` | Arm call disposition **Next** (**detached**; after **CALL** Auto-LF) |
| `run.py --await-arm` | Poll `arm_watch.log` until extract done |
| `run.py --foreground` | Debug only: blocking in-shell watch |

## After extract: 7-step + Auto-LF (mandatory)

Every EMAIL extract (typed RE or `--await-arm`):

1. Full **7-step RE**  
2. **`re_complete_sound.py --play-ready`**  
3. **Auto-LF** for this Fall # (Transfer Nein or Ja per §3) — user does **not** type `LF`  
4. If transfer → arm Weiter/Extern immediately; if non-transfer → stop and wait for **PR**

Every CALL after BRIEF pack: Auto-LF `--channel voice` → arm Next (or Weiter/Extern if transfer).

## Auto-arm after **PR** (EMAIL non-transfer / Anwenden)

LF was already done at RE time. When user sends **PR** / **pr** and paste + verify succeed:

1. **Immediately** arm Anwenden (detached):
   ```powershell
   Set-Location "c:\Users\PC ENTER\Desktop\Citrix"; uv run python .cursor/skills/sprinklr-read-answer-email/run.py --arm
   ```
   Expect **`ANWENDEN_RE_ARMED`** + **`ARM_WATCH_DETACHED`** + **`READY_FOR_YOUR_CLICK: Anwenden`**.
2. Chat: `Armed — click Anwenden now.` + `PR done for #FALL_ID` (or `PR LF done` if manual PR LF path).
3. Then **`--await-arm`** → next case → 7-step + Auto-LF again.

**Do not** arm Anwenden at Auto-LF time for non-transfer EMAIL (wait for PR).

### Auto-arm after **CALL** Auto-LF — disposition **Next**

After Auto-LF `--channel voice` succeeds:

1. **`--arm-next`** (not Anwenden) → Dexter → `LF done for #FALL_ID` → **`--await-arm`**  
2. User clicks exact **Next**. After extract: CHANNEL again → process + Auto-LF.

| Trigger | Arm when | Arm script | Then |
|---------|----------|------------|------|
| **PR** (EMAIL non-transfer; Auto-LF already done) | After PR paste+verify | **`--arm`** | **`--await-arm`** |
| **Auto-LF / LF TR** (transfer queue) | After transfer fill | **`--arm-weiter`** | **`--await-arm`** |
| **Auto-LF / LF TR** (transfer email) | After transfer fill | **`--arm-extern`** | **`--await-arm`** |
| **Auto-LF** (CALL voice) | After voice fill | **`--arm-next`** | **`--await-arm`** |
| Manual **PR LF** (recovery) | After PR + LF | **`--arm`** | **`--await-arm`** |

Do **not** arm twice for the same close-out. If a detached watch is already waiting, do not start a second overlapping arm.

## 7-step output

1. Customer summary  
2. Verification  
3. Transfer eligibility  
4a/4b. Backend / instructions  
5. Instructions on handling case  
6. Your response to customer (German, code block)  
7. Summary of response (EN) — then run **`re_complete_sound.py --play-ready`** (book) — then **Auto-LF**

## Integrity

- One visible case only; discard prior Fall # context on each new **RE**.
- PR pastes latest RE for the **same visible Fall #** only.
- Watch loop must **not** steal browser focus (`bring_to_front`) while waiting.
- **No monitor fallback:** If Anwenden-gated RE fails, **stop and report**. Do **not** fall into continuous `monitor_emails` / `get_new_emails` loops.

## Rollback

If this experiment fails or you dislike it, in the **instructions** chat type **`revert last`** — restores checkpoint `.cursor/revert-checkpoints/pre-anwenden-re/`.

## Hooks note

Requires project hooks enabled (`.cursor/hooks.json`). View **Output → Hooks** if sound does not play.
